ull,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_35","text":"Scarlet was always obsessed with becoming stronger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_36","text":"\"Just like Rose.\" or \"If only Rose were here.\" She was always muttering things like that, thinking no one heard her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_37","text":"The curse you placed on Scarlet gave her the strength to push forward, and it all worked out in the end.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_38","text":"But as her sister, that's not something you should have done.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_39","text":"You're right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_40","text":"That's why I'm still alive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_41","text":"?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_42","text":"Strictly speaking, I cannot die without Mirror's permission and I could disappear at any moment on her whim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_43","text":"But the reason I'm obeying Mirror and trying to stay alive...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_44","text":"is because I don't think I've ever given Scar anything good.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_45","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_46","text":"I ruined the squad in the name of helping her and made her kill her own sister by her own hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_47","text":"I've come to realize what a pathetic and awful sister I was.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_0