ore about Scar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_70","text":"How did she end up joining the Goddess Squad, the strongest squad there is?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_71","text":"And what has she accomplished since then?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_72","text":"All right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_73","text":"It's a bit of a long story.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_74","text":"Then keep it to the parts about Scar. I'm not big on long stories.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_75","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_75","text":"Snow White and Rose's voices echo around them,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_76","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_76","text":"as Nayuta and Mirror walk on, listening.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["nayuta","mirror_r"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_77","text":"They seem to be getting along.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_78","text":"How far dost thou intend to lead us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_79","text":"I confess, this leisurely stroll through the heart of enemy territory does not sit well with me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_80","text":"Not much further now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_81","text":"We wouldn't be able to go any further than that anyway.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_82","text":"So thou hast been here all this time?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_83","text":"That's right. I've been here ever since Eden. There's work to be done after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_84","text":"Then didst thou not see my replicas? There ought to have been at the very least several score.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_85","text":"Hmm... beats me. Maybe they're all dead?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_86","text":"When a replica doth perish, its NIMPH returneth unto me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_87","text":"Such a thing hath not occurred even once.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_88","text":"Is that so?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_89","text":"I haven't the faintest idea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_90","text":"... I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_91","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_92","text":"Is it... still intact?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_93","text":"Of course. That's why the Lift is in operation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_94","text":"The Ultra Massive Core is very much intact. It's in much better shape than anticipated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_95","text":"Who doth maintain it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_96","text":"It's left alone. It was designed to run itself after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_97","text":"By you, I might add.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_98","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_99","text":"The Ark and the Lift each hold one of the twin cores.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_100","text":"The moment either is destroyed, mutual destruction follows.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_101","text":"And in close proximity to one another, the resulting resonance would destroy them both.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_102","text":"Hehe. Quite the troublesome design.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_103","text":"There was surely reason behind its design.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_104","text":"Yet we failed to uncover that reason, and we erred in wielding forces unknowable in heedless fashion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_105","text":"Just so you know, mutual destruction is not an option.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_106","text":"It might have been a viable choice in the past, but not now with the Queen in the picture.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_107","text":"Humanity, stripped of its sanctuary, against the Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_108","text":"The outcome is obvious, wouldn't you say?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_46_06_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_46_06_109","text":"... This I know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}